Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:56:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fix: re-export googlePathKind from server.ts for v0.1.204

Upstream v0.1.204 ships googlePathKind itself (server.ts local definition,
merged from our fork commit). Our fork had moved it to util.ts, so the
rebase's 3-way dropped the upstream export and broke handle.ts/relay.ts/
vertex.test.ts imports from server.js. Restore the export as a util.ts
re-export (identical implementation) instead of deleting the imports.
Tests: adapt v1internal cases to stricter ParsedStreamEvent narrowing and
unknown candidate access via a candidatesOf helper.
---
 src/server.ts                |  1 +
 src/server/handle.ts         |  2 +-
 src/server/relay.ts          |  2 +-
 tests/adapter-google.test.ts | 27 +++++++++++++++++----------
 4 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

